WEBVTT

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:29.910
Time to eat.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.960
<b><i>The</i> Sale!!
Limited-time discount</b>

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:40.720
White, Round, Tiny, Wimpy, and Ready

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:45.380
Hello, Nadeshiko Deliveries.

00:02:45.700 --> 00:02:48.930
Package for Kashiwagi Sora-san.

00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:51.480
Coming.

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:52.730
Sorry.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:55.980
Kaede-san, can you get it?

00:03:02.170 --> 00:03:04.350
Kaede-san, are you alive?

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:05.370
Are you okay?

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:09.120
S-Sorry, Sora-kun.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.000
I have a deadline coming up.

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:13.270
Got it.

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:14.270
Break a leg.

00:03:14.270 --> 00:03:16.120
I'll make you a midnight snack later.

00:03:19.250 --> 00:03:21.130
Thank you for your hard work.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:23.260
Fragile

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:24.760
Here's your package.

00:03:25.130 --> 00:03:27.290
Thank you very much.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:28.390
It's huge!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.890
To: Kashiwagi Sora
From: Kashiwagi Mokuren

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:37.270
<b>Handle
with
care</b>

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:31.450
Damn it, Dad...

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:34.620
He's been silent for three months.

00:03:34.620 --> 00:03:36.370
What is it this time?

00:03:38.740 --> 00:03:41.630
A casket? Huh?

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:45.210
What is it, Dracula?

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.810
Why is this letter so thick?

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:56.530
"Hello, my dear son."

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:57.550
<i>Hello, my dear son,</i>

00:03:57.550 --> 00:03:59.730
<i>I love you!</i>

00:04:00.760 --> 00:04:02.630
<i>How've you been, Sora?</i>

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:07.040
<i>I'm in Egypt right now,</i>

00:04:07.730 --> 00:04:11.240
<i>and I found this intriguing mummy.</i>

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:14.350
<i>I figured I'd let you take care of it.</i>

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:15.940
What?!

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:18.030
There's a mummy in here?!

00:04:22.750 --> 00:04:24.880
Wait, it's not Dracula?!

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:28.090
Let's see, "It's a really..."

00:04:28.090 --> 00:04:30.920
<i>It's a really adorable mummy.</i>

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:33.470
<i>I'm sure you'll love it, too.</i>

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:35.210
Adorable?

00:04:35.650 --> 00:04:38.380
<i>Think of him as family. 
Be a good friend to him.</i>

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:40.130
A good friend?

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:47.330
<i>That's right.</i>

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:50.940
<i>Everything my dad's been sending 
to me so far has been...</i>

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:52.460
<i>How should I put it...</i>

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:53.520
<i>It's a...</i>

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:55.390
<i>Scary!</i>

00:04:55.930 --> 00:04:59.400
<i>One time, he sent me an "amusing" 
Daruma doll, and it was cursed.</i>

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:03.400
<i>Another time, he sent me a "good-luck 
scarecrow," and it was murderous.</i>

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:07.410
<i>Yet another, he sent me a Mary-san doll 
from the urban legend to "ward off evil."</i>

00:05:08.090 --> 00:05:11.040
<i>Knowing my dad...</i>

00:05:11.420 --> 00:05:13.910
<i>As cute as the mummy may be,</i>

00:05:14.640 --> 00:05:16.420
<i>this is how I'll end up.</i>

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:18.910
Weapons... weapons...

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:21.050
I need something to fight with!

00:05:47.450 --> 00:05:50.700
This is so unexpected that 
it's actually <i>more</i> terrifying!

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:55.740
It's tiny.

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:59.860
Wait, but given that it came from my dad...

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.830
I can't let my guard down.

00:06:03.830 --> 00:06:06.070
It might attack me.

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:10.940
It's soft.

00:06:12.080 --> 00:06:13.100
All right.

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:14.350
Let's just...

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.490
Let's send it back to Egypt.

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:24.230
Huh?

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:27.990
Wh-What?

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:28.920
Liquid?

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:34.370
It's crying?!

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:37.620
Are these mummy tears?

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:46.500
Nope.

00:06:46.500 --> 00:06:48.960
I'm wiping your tears right now.

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.260
Stay back.

00:06:52.700 --> 00:06:55.640
<i>I don't even know if it's safe yet.</i>

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:07.690
<i>Was I too harsh?</i>

00:07:15.590 --> 00:07:16.910
It's knocking!

00:07:20.100 --> 00:07:23.700
<i>I'm getting the feeling it isn't dangerous.</i>

00:07:24.610 --> 00:07:25.630
<i>But...</i>

00:07:27.200 --> 00:07:28.580
Here, go inside.

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:29.960
All clean, now.

00:07:29.960 --> 00:07:31.300
go back to Egypt.

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.010
Get away from me.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:54.530
Um...

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:58.820
Are you saying you want to stay here, 
and that you'll do the chores?

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:07.540
Like, I think it'll be hard for you.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:08.840
Because of your size.

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:26.110
All right, all right.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.740
Give it a try, then.

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:32.740
I knew it.

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:36.370
Of course.

00:08:38.210 --> 00:08:38.990
Hey!

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:43.790
Spit out what you drank!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:44.530
Spit it out!

00:08:53.780 --> 00:08:55.450
Listen, you...

00:08:56.590 --> 00:08:58.390
What am I supposed to do?

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:03.730
<i>I'll write down everything I 
know about the mummy so far.</i>

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:07.580
I'll feel better if I know how it lives.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:08.640
Thank goodness.

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:10.900
Dad doesn't usually follow through like this.

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.650
Order: Mummy
Family: Mummy
Species: Mummy
Characteristics: Small
Warning: Don't take the bandage off

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:13.650
Pervert!

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:18.030
<i>All I can tell is that it's a mummy.</i>

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:20.510
Mummy...

00:09:20.510 --> 00:09:21.730
Mummy...

00:09:22.020 --> 00:09:22.790
There.

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:33.170
<i>You don't look anything like this.</i>

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:50.440
<i>I mean, he's already here.</i>

00:09:51.050 --> 00:09:54.440
<i>I can't bring myself to send him back now.</i>

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:59.840
<i>He's going to need a name if 
I'm going to take care of him.</i>

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.680
<i>He's a mummy, so...</i>

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:03.930
<i>Miiko?</i>

00:10:03.930 --> 00:10:05.000
<i>Miimii?</i>

00:10:10.340 --> 00:10:11.540
Pochi.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:14.170
<b>Mummy
(Miira)</b>

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:13.650
What's wrong, Pochi?

00:10:14.430 --> 00:10:16.090
You sleepwalked into it?

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:21.990
There, there.

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:23.430
That must have hurt.

00:10:27.180 --> 00:10:28.550
There, there.

00:10:29.210 --> 00:10:30.180
Oh...

00:10:30.460 --> 00:10:33.880
<i>Do dogs and mummies fight 
when they're kept together?</i>

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:38.210
Just a second, Pochi.

00:10:38.210 --> 00:10:40.450
I'm in the middle of a thought.

00:10:41.260 --> 00:10:42.340
All right.

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:43.700
Time for dinner?

00:10:44.670 --> 00:10:45.970
Dinner...

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:48.580
<i>What do mummies eat, anyway?</i>

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:53.590
Come on, Pochi, why are 
you being such a baby?

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:56.840
Good girl.

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:09.610
Did you just bark?

00:11:18.640 --> 00:11:19.820
H-Hey!

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.530
You don't want to fall!

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:28.040
Jeez, stop running!

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:30.660
No hiding, either!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.130
Hey!

00:11:32.950 --> 00:11:34.980
Hold on, Pochi.

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:38.050
Okay, okay.

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:39.440
Sheesh.

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:41.550
Don't get so jealous.

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.930
<b>Being hugged</b>

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:48.930
<b>Just clinging on</b>

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:54.940
He barked again.

00:11:55.790 --> 00:11:56.320
Huh?

00:11:57.370 --> 00:11:58.690
Hey, settle down, now.

00:11:59.630 --> 00:12:00.200
Okay...

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:01.210
Shh...

00:12:01.630 --> 00:12:02.450
Be quiet.

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:06.950
Be quiet!

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:11.330
You don't need to bark so hard that you choke.

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.350
Are you okay?

00:12:14.350 --> 00:12:16.980
Here, get down, you.

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:17.880
Um...

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.290
Name...

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:20.590
Name...

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:24.320
Mii-kun.

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:28.220
I don't want you to fall off.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.430
Get down.

00:12:30.610 --> 00:12:32.480
Okay, Mii-kun?

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:36.110
"Name"

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:38.610
"Mii-kun"

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:41.070
"He gave me a name"

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:43.610
"Which means..."

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:47.450
"I get to stay here"

00:12:54.430 --> 00:12:57.840
<i>A-Are you </i>that<i> happy with your name?</i>

00:13:00.770 --> 00:13:05.800
<i>Hey, you're pretty cute.</i>

00:13:08.830 --> 00:13:11.060
Why don't we get you some water?

00:13:19.630 --> 00:13:21.280
Here you go, Mii-kun.

00:13:22.130 --> 00:13:22.950
There.

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:24.070
Water.

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:27.760
<i>That's</i> how you do it?!

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:30.190
Figures.

00:13:31.470 --> 00:13:35.930
Mii-kun, you have to hold 
it up with both your hands

00:13:35.930 --> 00:13:37.490
and put it up to your lips.

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:39.060
That way, you can keep your face dry.

00:13:41.640 --> 00:13:43.460
That just made it worse!

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:44.710
Oh, yeah...

00:13:45.080 --> 00:13:47.700
It spills because the rim is so wide.

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:50.540
What else could I use?

00:13:55.340 --> 00:13:58.310
It's worth hanging onto things sometimes.

00:14:01.620 --> 00:14:03.430
Oh, right, dinner.

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:05.240
Hang on, I'll get you your dinner.

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:08.300
<i>That's right.</i>

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:11.950
<i>What should I feed him?</i>

00:14:18.720 --> 00:14:20.480
<i>He's totally watching.</i>

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:25.460
I guess I'll try a few things.

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:27.610
Lettuce...

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:30.180
Cucumbers...

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:34.970
Tomatoes will probably leave 
a stain, so let's not.

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:39.710
Small fish, meat, bacon, udon,

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:41.450
shirataki noodles...

00:14:41.450 --> 00:14:43.610
Apples are all I've got for fruit.

00:14:44.090 --> 00:14:47.500
I don't have any Egypt-ish food.

00:14:47.940 --> 00:14:50.940
Maybe I should have bought some molokhiya.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.620
I'll cut it into bite-size pieces.

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:06.260
W-Wait, that's for dogs!

00:15:11.450 --> 00:15:13.760
Cucumbers are no good.

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:15.700
Apples...

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:22.640
He ate the apple!

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:29.240
Apples are a go.

00:15:29.240 --> 00:15:30.650
Good, good.

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:32.390
Let's circle that.

00:15:36.270 --> 00:15:37.310
It's okay!

00:15:37.310 --> 00:15:38.790
You don't have to force yourself!

00:15:40.550 --> 00:15:42.860
Shirataki noodles are okay.

00:15:46.360 --> 00:15:48.420
Look at the time!

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:51.350
I have to make Kaede-san's night snack!

00:15:58.920 --> 00:15:59.610
Huh?

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:01.640
Mii-kun?

00:16:12.400 --> 00:16:13.450
Of course.

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:15.280
You must be tired.

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:18.060
You came all the way to Japan from Egypt.

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:22.540
Good night, Mii-kun.

00:16:27.970 --> 00:16:29.270
Ah...

00:16:29.270 --> 00:16:31.550
Your dad contacted you, huh?

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:34.180
Yeah, but...

00:16:34.580 --> 00:16:37.050
He sent you something weird again?

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:41.020
Get this, Tazuki, it wasn't weird this time.

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:43.260
That's actually even creepier.

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:44.270
Right?

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.210
Why would my dad send me 
something normal, right?

00:16:46.590 --> 00:16:48.440
What did he send you?

00:16:50.200 --> 00:16:52.130
A mummy, like, this small.

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:53.660
That's normal?

00:16:54.000 --> 00:16:55.380
Want to come see?

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:57.830
Yeah, I might as well.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:03.300
Thanks for coming shopping with me.

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:03.920
Nah.

00:17:04.350 --> 00:17:07.060
You bought a lot of shirataki, though.

00:17:07.060 --> 00:17:08.460
Oh, this?

00:17:08.460 --> 00:17:10.090
Are you having a shirataki 
festival or something?

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:12.680
Nah.

00:17:12.680 --> 00:17:14.040
It's food for the mummy.

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:17.800
He eats apples, too, 
but he slurps up the shirataki.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.100
We run out really fast.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:22.100
He loves shirataki, huh?

00:17:22.100 --> 00:17:23.070
Yeah.

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:25.480
He's just the most amusing mummy.

00:17:25.480 --> 00:17:26.850
He even barks.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:30.110
I can't picture that.

00:17:32.110 --> 00:17:34.770
I bet you'll be amazed.

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:37.360
He's got a pudgy belly. 
He's nothing like a mumm—

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:41.620
He's turned into an actual mummy!

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:42.840
What the heck?!

00:17:42.840 --> 00:17:44.570
Mii-kun, what's wrong?

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:47.320
I thought that was default...

00:17:47.320 --> 00:17:49.270
Tazuki, watch Mii-kun for me!

00:17:49.270 --> 00:17:50.380
All right.

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:55.900
I want to know what's inside...

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.890
Mii-kun, water!

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.560
Welcome back, Mii-kun!

00:18:11.060 --> 00:18:12.320
Wait, wait.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:15.030
Am I the only one who thinks 
there's <i>a lot</i> wrong about this?

00:18:15.520 --> 00:18:17.780
Is that really a mummy?

00:18:18.060 --> 00:18:20.360
I guess this is what some mummies look like.

00:18:20.360 --> 00:18:23.280
I mean, we've never seen a mummy before.

00:18:23.280 --> 00:18:26.910
I hate that you make it sound so persuasive.

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:31.420
Have you told Kaede-san?

00:18:31.940 --> 00:18:36.170
I did tell her, but she's racing 
to meet a deadline right now.

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:40.200
Right, a mummy.

00:18:40.200 --> 00:18:42.180
Got it, I look forward to having it later.

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:44.280
"Look forward to having it"?

00:18:44.280 --> 00:18:46.560
I think she had it confused 
with her midnight snack.

00:18:48.020 --> 00:18:49.510
Here, Mii-kun.

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:51.810
This is my friend, Tazuki.

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:53.760
Say "Nice to meet you."

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:04.860
He's shaking.

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:10.130
Huh?

00:19:13.510 --> 00:19:14.080
Hey...

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:15.210
Wait, stop.

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:16.960
Hey!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:18.310
Mii-kun?

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:21.240
Sorry, Tazuki.

00:19:21.240 --> 00:19:22.470
I don't know what's gotten into him.

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:27.840
No, it's a good thing to be cautious.

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:30.980
I think he's really cute.

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:37.920
Seeing him like this makes me

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:40.820
<b>Let me toy with him</b>

00:19:36.270 --> 00:19:40.820
<b>Let me toy with him</b>

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:40.640
want to try all sorts of things on him.

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:43.180
I got it, Tazuki.

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:45.990
Mii-kun saw through you.

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:48.860
Later.

00:19:48.860 --> 00:19:49.710
Yeah.

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:52.820
See you soon.

00:19:54.550 --> 00:19:55.850
Jeez!

00:19:55.850 --> 00:19:56.680
Later.

00:19:58.570 --> 00:19:59.960
Sheesh.

00:20:00.750 --> 00:20:03.090
Don't worry, Mii-kun.

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:05.160
Okay, let's have dinner.

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:15.420
I'm going to go take a bath.

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:18.230
Take care of Mii-kun in the meantime, Pochi.

00:20:22.600 --> 00:20:23.330
What?

00:20:23.330 --> 00:20:24.870
I'll be right back.

00:20:25.360 --> 00:20:28.040
Or do you want to take a bath with me?

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:29.120
Just kidding.

00:20:31.080 --> 00:20:32.870
Oh, seriously?

00:20:39.940 --> 00:20:42.340
Mii-kun are you sure you'll be okay?

00:20:43.620 --> 00:20:45.740
You were taking baths in Egypt, too, right?

00:20:46.690 --> 00:20:48.640
Okay, then...

00:20:56.920 --> 00:20:58.120
You float?

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:01.740
Th-That's awesome.

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.250
<i>Weird.</i>

00:21:04.690 --> 00:21:08.950
<i>I figured mummies wouldn't like water.</i>

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:13.280
<i>But there are </i>yamamba<i> yokai</i>

00:21:13.280 --> 00:21:16.000
<i>who love humans and gods of 
fortune who like poor people.</i>

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.960
<i>I guess there are plenty of 
things stranger than this mummy.</i>

00:21:23.570 --> 00:21:26.570
<i>It's a really adorable mummy.</i>

00:21:26.570 --> 00:21:29.080
<i>Think of him as family. 
Be a good friend to him.</i>

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:36.160
Family, huh?

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:40.310
Well, time to get out.

00:21:44.170 --> 00:21:45.700
What happened to your body?!

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:48.220
What are you, a water balloon?

00:21:48.220 --> 00:21:49.700
Do I just wring you?

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:54.020
You're all pudgy and bloated!

00:23:39.390 --> 00:23:40.540
That scared me.

00:23:41.290 --> 00:23:42.860
That seriously scared me.

00:23:43.700 --> 00:23:46.590
Thank goodness you're back to normal.

00:23:50.630 --> 00:23:54.100
The mummy my dad sent me is named Mii-kun.

00:23:54.100 --> 00:23:57.120
It's 12 centimeters tall, 
waist circumference 18 centimeters,

00:23:57.120 --> 00:23:59.790
weighing 175 grams.

00:23:59.710 --> 00:24:04.630
Next Episode
Toyed With and Chased 
Around, Being Small is Hard

00:24:00.280 --> 00:24:03.150
See you on the next episode 
of <i>How to Keep a Mummy</i>.

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:09.130
<b>Please watch again!</b>
